==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|pl|szabas}} from {{der|ru|yi|שבת||tr=shabes|Sabbath}}, from {{der|ru|he|שַׁבָּת|tr=shabát}}. {{doublet|ru|суббо́та}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ша́баш}}
* {{ru-IPA|шаба́ш}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|ша́баш|or|шаба́ш}}

# [[Saturday]], observed in Judaism as a day of rest, [[Sabbath]].
# A meeting of witches, presided over by the devil, [[Sabbath]].
